description:
crl.rs check_revocation uses a manual for loop to find the revoked entry:
  for entry in revoked { if &entry.serial_number == cert_serial { return Err(...) } }
This is equivalent to:
  if let Some(entry) = revoked.iter().find(|e| &e.serial_number == cert_serial) { return Err(...) }
Or with early return flipped. The iterator version is more expressive and harder to accidentally skip the early return.
